    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Not all Rogues skulk in the shadows of cities. In Lyonesse, some take to the deep forests and tangled greenways, striking from hidden paths to defy cruel lords and protect the helpless. These Outlaws are folk heroes to commoners and hunted criminals to nobility. Whether driven by vengeance or compassion, Outlaws steal not for greed, but to redress the balance of a broken world.</p>"
